---
import FullNavigationLayout from "../../astro/layouts/FullNavigationLayout.astro";
---

<FullNavigationLayout>
  <main class="mr-container mr-shell__main">
    <h1>Dialogs and popovers</h1>
    <p>
      The old component-specific dialog/popover documentation has been superseded by the Layer
      subsystem. Markup Refine keeps native <code>&lt;dialog&gt;</code> and Popover API state as the
      browser source of truth and adds a small shared lifecycle around them.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="../../usage/layer-primitives/">Modal and drawer Layers</a></li>
      <li><a href="../../usage/popovers-tooltips/">Popovers and pinned tooltips</a></li>
      <li><a href="../../usage/layer-api/">Stable Layer API</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Do not revive old overlay classes or a separate focus/backdrop state machine. Use native
      dialog/popover markup directly when Layer coordination is unnecessary.
    </p>
  </main>
</FullNavigationLayout>
